{title: Aage Bhi Jaane Na Tu}
{artist: Asha Bhosle Ravi}
{key: D}

{c: Verse 1}
Aage [D]bhi.. jaane na [G]tu..        pichhe [G]bhi jaane na [A]tu
jo bhi [D]hai [A]bas yahin ek [D]pal hai,        Anjaane [D]saayon ka raahon mey dera hai
andekhi [G]baahon ne hum sabko [D]ghera hai
Yeh pal u [D]jalaa hai baaki andhera hai
yeh pal ga [G]waana naa yeh pal hi [D]tera hai
[D]jinevaale [G]soch le [Bm]yahi vaqt [A]hai,        kar le puri [D]aarazu
is pal [D]ki jalavo ne mahafil savaari hai
is pal ki [G]garmi ne dhadakan ubhaari hai [D]
is pal ke [D]hone se duniyaa hamaari hai
ye pal jo [G]dekho to sadiyo pe vaari hai,        [D]jinevaale [G]soch le [Bm]yahi vaqt [A]hai
kar le puri [D]aarazu,        is pal [D]ke saae me apanaa thikaanaa hai
is pal ki [G]aage ki har shay fasaanaa hai [D]
kal kisane [D]dekhaa hai kal kisane jaanaa hai
is pal se [G]paaegaa jo tujhako paanaa hai,        [D]jinevaale [G]soch le [Bm]yahi vaqt [A]hai
kar le puri [D]aarazu
